      "name": "dsh-plugin-organizer",
      "title": {
        "en": "Plugin Settings Organizer",
        "zh": "插件设置收纳"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Groups the settings navigation into two bands: entries shipped with dsh stay on top, entries registered by installed plugins move below them behind a divider with a live count. Inside the plugin band, entries are grouped by category, can be renamed, and can be promoted into the top band — all driven by nav-config.json.",
        "zh": "把设置导航分成两组：dsh 自带的入口在上，已安装插件注册的入口在下，中间用带实时计数的分割线分开。插件区内还可按类别分组、给入口改名、把某些第三方入口提升到官方区——全部由 nav-config.json 驱动。"
      },
